### ===================================================================
### TASKFLOW REST API TEST REQUESTS
### Jalankan dengan REST Client extension (VS Code) atau curl
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Ambil Seluruh Daftar Tugas (READ ALL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 2. Tambah Tugas Baru - Berhasil (CREATE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Mengerjakan Modul 3 & 4 SKPL",
  "deskripsi": "Membuat antarmuka responsif dan menghubungkan API",
  "deadline": "2026-11-20",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 3. Tambah Tugas - Validasi Negatif TC-02 (Form Judul Kosong)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "   ",
  "deskripsi": "Harus ditolak oleh sistem"
}

### 4. Toggle Status Tugas - TC-01 (Ubah Pending -> Completed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1/toggle
Accept: application/json

### 5. Update Rincian Tugas (UPDATE)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul": "Implementasi Antarmuka Tailwind CSS (Revisi)",
  "deskripsi": "Memperbarui styling dan integrasi script modular",
  "deadline": "2026-11-18",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 6. Hapus Tugas (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/3
Accept: application/json
